      "mergeable": true,
      "draft": true,
      "body": "## Why\n\nQuds needs optional local German linguistic analysis and conservative manual grammar suggestions while keeping its deterministic proofing behavior and editor ownership guarantees.\n\n## What this branch adds\n\n- An optional Linux x86-64/AVX2, de-DE, CPU/F32 adapter for the accepted CrispEmbed native spaCy ABI, with fixed model and notice hashes, authenticated native library, counted UTF-8 input, and independently checked byte/scalar/UTF-16 spans.\n- A persistent owned worker with bounded requests, stale-result rejection, cancellation settlement and awaited cleanup.\n- An explicit Studio annotation view and a separate default-disabled `SpacyGrammarProvider` manual API. The grammar planner requires reviewed lexical evidence; deterministic findings retain precedence. Stock Studio does not register the grammar provider automatically.\n\n## W6 result and scope\n\nThe first sealed 86-case panel is complete: combined exact corrections rise from 5/30 to 22/30, adding 17 and losing none of the baseline's five. Native findings are zero on all 42 valid and ten guard inputs. Four unsupported locales are explicit. All eight misses remain in the original result. All 22 corrected rechecks have no further finding; four conservatively abstain. This finite assistant-authored panel is not a population precision/recall estimate.\n\n[Complete W6 evidence and audited handoff](https://github.com/CrispStrobe/quds_office_suite/tree/20026ff49ac37391e2a1fd0947560a587f2f7332/docs/validation/native-spacy-w6-20261117)\n\nThe source seal at `84b4120ca29715d9b6f6555d1393f5fcb97e47cf` precedes the preserved first result at `3a8bca4f8f8744bbb0fbd6809a700b5768d5ceba`. Both the original native acceptance and W6 qualification are consumed and must not be rerun or used as a tuning set.\n\n## Local verification\n\nThe recorded current-source checks pass 73 package tests, 869 German/shared-facts tests, 75 existing editor proofing controls, 36 German editor integration tests and ten actual-native editor controls. Browser imports report native execution as unavailable. Native/model bytes remain unchanged.\n\nW7 packaging and device qualification continue on `feat/native-spacy-w7-20261118`; immutable hosted distribution, other platforms and production activation remain separate gates. No GitHub Actions/status endpoint has been queried, awaited or rerun for this continuation.",
      "title": "Add optional native German analysis and qualified manual agreement corrections",
